    "dynamic_testimonials": {
      "type": "dynamic-testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_Q4Gm3B": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5427.jpg",
            "star_rating": "5",
            "text": "<p>I always recommend Deesse to absolutely everyone who is looking for shoes in Tallinn and wants to try them on before buying 😍 And shoe stockings are just heart-breaking. Wherever I go dancing, everyone is shocked that they are separate from the shoes and look so good 👍🏽</p>",
            "author": "<p>- <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lilymihhailova/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/lilymihhailova/?hl=en\">Lily</a>, famous dancer</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_GUREVN": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5431.jpg",
            "star_rating": "5",
            "text": "<p>Wonderful selection of Pleaser dance shoes! All my recent purchases were made at Deesse. Thanks to excellent communication and the convenient store location, all the shoes I bought arrived very quickly or were already available for trying on and purchasing in the store.</p>",
            "author": "<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kma_videos/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/kma_videos/?hl=en\">@kma_videos</a>, famous videographer</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial-5": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5428.jpg",
            "star_rating": "5",
            "text": "<p>The customer service has been excellent, the products are well made, have interesting designs and are of good quality. And the best part is that you can get all the heels in no time! Lovely warm people behind the sensual & feminine brand</p>",
            "author": "<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/aizamatix/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/aizamatix/?hl=en\">- Diana, famous dancer</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_CyiaDM": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5433.jpg",
            "star_rating": "5",
            "text": "<p>I adore these seamless sets! For several years now, this clothing has delighted me with comfort that feels like a second skin. They are versatile for everyday use, office, walks, or workouts. Nothing is see-through, everything stretches perfectly, and they highlight your body shape beautifully</p>",
